    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Snake is the latest evolution of the classical snake game. We've added combat and roguelite mechanics - earn levels, upgrade your Mecha Snake and defeat bosses while dodging enemy attacks! <br><br>Everybody has at least once played a snake game on their phone. We took that classical formula and upgraded it a lot. Now you need to kill enemies and bosses by collecting powers. Every level gives a choice of multiple upgrades which will help you in combat and survival. Dont forget to not bite your own tail aswell!</p>",
